once(OUT/'OLD_SOURCE_PEER_READER_PRECISION_001.md',('''# Distinct source-peer reader precision

The old Source003 peer has51 top-level fields and an exact12-field nestedraw_policy_facts object. Driver391reads the full SHA-pinned peer under2097152;393–394compare selected typedSource003core;395–409check nestedfacts,API,binding/authors. The new Source005 peer has38 top-level fields and2553985bytes,456833 over the old cap, and lacks the old role structures.

