handoff = f'''# Compact Consumer005 source capsule

FROZEN SOURCE PREPARATION ONLY; DIFFERENT CAPSULE DERIVATION PEER PENDING.

Choice010 {pins['root_choice010']['sha256']} authorizes compact capsule/precision only. Capsule{len(capsule_bytes)}bytes <=131072, SHA{sha(capsule_bytes)}, has{len(capsule)} distinct closed top-level fields and an explicit nominal core (builtinexacttypes/int-not-bool/false/None). Its genuine Python6 creation is{created}. Full5a283 is externally anchored accepted STATIC source/causal preparation; this capsule author cites that existing differentSource005 acceptance and does not self-approve the new capsule.

Preserved{len(pairs)} selected original/copy pairs include full5a283,Source005manifest/post/binding/test/Raw4/all5roles, six004comparison files, attributed inertcode metadata,RootChoices010/007,designpeer and wrongdesign history, old51/nested12 peer and legacyreader. All originals were read three times before copies; all pairs three times plus finalpost. No full884 recursive audit or unknown-file absence is inferred.

Reproduction: validate input SHA/size rows and nominal data schema, follow CAPSULE_DERIVATION_MAP_001, compare full capsule bytes/SHA. RawAST85/7/36/1/API12/sevenroles andcaps395799/361287 are rederived; four predicate reversals in each source recover004 byte-exact, preserving all otherAST/import/default/guard behavior. Test has two direct sibling classes19+5,24 potential IDs; prior19AST retained; all24 collection/results UNRUN/None. M1–M4 probes/mutations/logs/healthy/restored controls are future assertions. Pathisinstance semantics remain qualified. InertCodeType flags/digests are pinned author attribution, with no new compile/definitions/calls.

OLD_SOURCE_PEER_READER_PRECISION_001 corrects oldTOP51/nested12/selectedcore versusnewTOP38/2553985/over2MiB456833/missingoldstructures. Wrongdesign001 bytes remain unchanged history. No oldSource003 schema union or cap widening was implemented.

No reader/harness/event1024grammar/binding/auth/ACK/unit/live/native/science/epoch/history/public changes. FutureRoot or eligible differentpeer must validate capsule/derivation/closure before a separate implementation choice. Current metadata capture status is outside this source artifact; no actual context or freshness is claimed here.
'''
once(OUT/'HANDOFF_001.md',handoff.encode('ascii'))

# Finite outputs only, before their manifest/post records; no recursive history copying.
payload_names = ['PREPARE_COMPACT_STATIC_SOURCE_CAPSULE_001.py'] + [str(Path('inputs')/(key+'.bytes')) for key,_ in selected] + [
